The first calculation is:
Training Load = Duration × sRPE

For example:
60 minutes × RPE 5 = 300 AU
So each session becomes a quantitative workload value.

Weekly load
Weekly Load = Sum of all session loads in that week

Training monotony
Monotony =
Mean Daily Load / Standard Deviation of Daily Load
Training strain
Strain =
Weekly Load × Training Monotony
Week-to-week change
Load Change % =
(Current Week Load - Previous Week Load)
/
Previous Week Load × 100